  (text "MCU BLOCK"
    (at 205.74 270.51 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "01bcdf14-73b0-4034-80e2-ac0efdd8ba3d")
  )
  (text "U1 ESP32-C6-WROOM-1-N8 pin plan (signal | GPIO | why)\nCC1, CC2 | IO0, IO1 | CC voltage sense (ADC1_CH0/1), 1 nF filters\nADC_DRDY | IO2 | probe ADC data-ready, 10k pull-up (ADC1_CH2)\nLOAD_FAULT | IO3 | load switch fault flags (pull-up R7 on power block)\nUSB_DN, USB_DP | IO12, IO13 | native USB Serial/JTAG\nLED | IO10 | status LED D2 via 680R\nBTN | IO9 | button SW1 to GND (also boot-strap pin: held low at reset = download mode)\nFAN_EN | IO11 | fan load switch enable\nFAN_PWM, FAN_TACH | IO18, IO19 | fan drive, open-collector tach with 10k pull-up\nSERVO_PWM, SERVO_EN | IO20, IO21 | servo signal, servo load switch enable\nI2C_SDA, I2C_SCL | IO22, IO23 | I2C bus (ATECC608B, ADC), 4.7k pull-ups here\nUART_TX, UART_RX | TXD0 (IO16), RXD0 (IO17) | bring-up console on test pads\nEN | EN | 10k pull-up + 1uF reset RC, TP_EN\nSpare, no-connect | IO4 IO5 IO6 IO7 IO8 IO15 | IO4/5 strapping on module, IO8/IO15 strapping (no resistors)"
    (at 205.74 378.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "b1da903e-7b06-4021-8892-18965afe534e")
  )
